48_5202587497473315011_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sVUOD7D8Op4Q7kNvwGFs6vQ&_nc_oc=Adr7tWhFkN1h3bo9BwQSMeWkcQBVfkK421yyAtXNNvZAAHquQjmT_rDRsnErZnVV6Es&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQQOHdAt4C3SYNL-6MSCCGbZ8PUs8zCtzrHGjZOmZOWTw&oe=6AECA0A4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "NEW_NurseSim_Simlogic_Landscape_sep2026.png", "id": "1289918843184424", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1289918846517757_7025777987388135305_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1K5MGC-yxsUQ7kNvwGwxIi1&_nc_oc=AdporwKGfFz4Fy3dLeYK5X1kOMoA-sah9QUvfhXvc2YHpFwGwI2bn5z5YKPN7eN6r80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRfnlmYt2YRlijk2uycphRj3FGhmatsH3h5MEv9PV5tRw&oe=6AECA01F"}, "display_name": "VR Nurse Simulation", "keywords": ["Skillupvr", "Nurse", "skillup", "nurse", "skillupvr"], "long_description": "VR Nurse Simulation is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-assessment, the NEWS2 scoring system and ISBAR communication techniques.\n\n- 8 training scenarios of different patient profiles\n- Multiplayer setup\n- English and Norwegian language options\n- Intuitive, interactive and wireless\n- Compatible with Meta Quest 2 and 3\n- NEWS2 Scoring System \n- ISBAR Communication Framework\n- Facilitator control, communication and supervision capability *\n\n* Add-on application.", "short_description": "VR Nurse Simulation is designed for junior healthcare professionals to practice their basic nursing skills. Developed together with a Norwegian vocational institution, the simulation pack offers multiple scenarios set in both clinical and home environments, for users to familarize themselves with ABCDE-as